==English==

===Etymology===
Apparently from the sound made; believed to have first appeared in comic strips.

===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# {{context|often|repeated several times|lang=en}} The sound of a cat coughing up a [[hairball]].
# Also used of similar noises, particularly one made to show disgust or disapproval.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To make a 'gack' noise.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To expectorate a hairball.

